{"id":"actual","lemma":"actual","pos":"adj","rank":1983,"glosses":["present, current","factual","actual, real"],"ipa":"/aɡˈtwal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"actuales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-actual.wav","examples":[{"text":"Dime tu dirección actual, por favor.","en":"Please tell me your present address.","words":[{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"direction"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"please"]]},{"text":"¿Cuál es el costo actual?","en":"What's the actual cost?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461887","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"cost"},null]},{"text":"Conocí a mi novia actual en el gimnasio.","en":"I got to know my current girlfriend at the gym.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692096","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"a type of sweet roll"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"gym, gymnasium"}]},{"text":"La mujer que se sienta allí es su esposa actual.","en":"The woman sitting over there is his present wife.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692480","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"wife"},null]},{"text":"¿Me puedes decir tu domicilio actual?","en":"Could you tell me your present address?","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to say"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"domicile"},null]}]}